    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was also reading some older clinical notes about how certain populations might present differently with pain management, specifically regarding how much pain they actually report or how much anesthesia they need. do you have any info on whether there are biological or physiological differences in pain perception or tolerance based on race? like, is there a known correlation i should know for the boards?",
